IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgba-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Broadcasting (Class Licence) (Amendment) Notification 2004 (S 196/2004), made under ss 9 and 11 of the Act.
-- Deposit: ../../../broadcasting-class-licence-amendment-notification-2004/registers/source-bundle/BA1994-S196-2004.txt (e-Gazette PDF, pdftotext -layout, unedited). Quotations below are lines of THAT file; `srcrefs.py` is run on this module against it.
-- First published 15 April 2004 at 5:00 pm; "shall come into operation on 15th April 2004" (paragraph 1).
-- It inserts paragraph 11A in the Schedule to the Class Licence Notification (N 1, 2004 Ed.), which the lawplain text of N 1 does not serve.

§ `Paragraph 2: paragraph 11A inserted in the Schedule`

-- src:3 | First published in the Government Gazette, Electronic Edition, on 15th April 2004 at 5:00 pm.
-- src:21 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Broadcasting (Class
-- src:22 | Licence) (Amendment) Notification 2004 and shall come into
-- src:23 | operation on 15th April 2004.
@ref S 196/2004 publication line and para 1 (commencement) (src:3-23)
GIVEN `the day of the conduct` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 196/2004 the amendment is in operation on` MEANS
    `the day of the conduct` AT LEAST (Date 15 4 2004)

-- src:26 | 2. The Schedule to the Broadcasting (Class Licence) Notification
-- src:27 | (N 1, 2004 Ed.) is amended by inserting, immediately after
-- src:28 | paragraph 11, the following paragraph:
-- src:29 | ‘‘11A. A licensee who provides an audiotext service shall register with
-- src:30 | the Authority within 14 days of 15th April 2004, or in the case where it
-- src:31 | provides the service after that date, within 14 days of providing the service.’’.
@ref S 196/2004 para 2: Schedule to N 1, para 11A (an audiotext service licensee registers within 14 days of 15 April 2004, or of providing the service) (src:26-31)
GIVEN `the licensee provides an audiotext service` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the service was already provided on 15 April 2004` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of days from 15 April 2004, or from the day the service started if later, to the registration` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 196/2004 N 1 Schedule para 11A the licensee has registered in time` MEANS
    (NOT `the licensee provides an audiotext service`) OR (`the number of days from 15 April 2004, or from the day the service started if later, to the registration` AT MOST 14)
